Error: Jet.SemicolonWithoutLineBreak: A `;` can't stand here, because a line break here would not end the statement
  --> Tests/UI/semicolon_without_line_break.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     total: 1; + 2
    |             ^
 Why: A `;` means exactly a line break, so it stands only where a line break would end the statement; here the next line would continue this one, or nothing before it is a statement to end.
 Fix: Remove the `;`, or finish the statement before it.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.SemicolonWithoutLineBreak
